WEBVTT

00:00:17.451 --> 00:00:19.818
<i>Drew: like when you put
on "a little" eye shadow.</i>

00:00:24.253 --> 00:00:26.286
<i>And, you know, all this stuff,</i>

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:28.286
<i>It's just very unprofessional.</i>

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.886
<i>Don't touch the troll!</i>

00:00:30.919 --> 00:00:33.353
<i>Is that what your mom
used to say to your dates?</i>

00:00:39.253 --> 00:00:40.787
<i>Put the trolls down,</i>

00:00:40.820 --> 00:00:42.919
<i>Or i'll put a staple
right between your eyes.</i>

00:00:43.953 --> 00:00:45.653
<i>Now, i know it's hard.</i>

00:00:45.687 --> 00:00:48.453
<i>It's hard to look up when you're down.</i>

00:00:48.487 --> 00:00:51.286
<i>It's hard to look up and see the light.</i>

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.553
<i>But i'm here to tell you folks...</i>

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.220
<i>The lord is with you.</i>

00:01:07.553 --> 00:01:10.120
<i>You don't have to suffer.</i>

00:01:10.153 --> 00:01:12.120
<i>You don't have to be lost.</i>

00:01:12.153 --> 00:01:14.286
<i>The lord is talking to you right now.</i>

00:01:14.320 --> 00:01:17.487
<i>He's saying, "you are my
child, and you have a purpose."</i>

00:01:18.787 --> 00:01:21.587
<i>You think god forgot
about you? I tell you, no!</i>

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:23.186
<i>All you got to do is listen.</i>

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:25.754
<i>Can't you just hear
those angels singing?</i>

00:01:25.787 --> 00:01:27.320
<i>Isn't it beautiful?</i>

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:31.553
<i>It's time.</i>

00:01:31.587 --> 00:01:34.453
<i>It's time to receive
the message he's sending.</i>

00:01:34.487 --> 00:01:38.086
<i>It's time to listen to the word of god!</i>

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:40.854
<i>Can you hear the glory?</i>

00:01:40.886 --> 00:01:42.820
<i>I said, can't you just hear it?</i>

00:01:42.854 --> 00:01:45.553
<i>I say, can't you just hear the lord?</i>

00:02:22.203 --> 00:02:24.736
Good morning. You're not the usual guy.

00:02:26.404 --> 00:02:29.836
No, uh... just filling in.

00:02:29.870 --> 00:02:32.237
So, how you feeling today, gloria?

00:02:32.270 --> 00:02:34.836
I've never felt better.

00:02:34.870 --> 00:02:38.304
So, no disturbances lately?

00:02:38.337 --> 00:02:41.037
You mean, am i stark-Raving
cuckoo for cocoa puffs?

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:43.636
I didn't say that.

00:02:43.670 --> 00:02:45.870
It's all right. I know
what people must think.

00:02:45.903 --> 00:02:48.270
<i>What do you think?</i>

00:02:48.304 --> 00:02:50.770
I think what i saw was real.

00:03:03.770 --> 00:03:06.636
I'd like to know what you saw.

00:03:09.937 --> 00:03:12.103
It was all over the news.

00:03:12.137 --> 00:03:13.903
I stabbed a man in the heart.

00:03:13.937 --> 00:03:15.736
Why would you do that?

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:17.536
Because it was god's will.

00:03:19.103 --> 00:03:20.903
Did god talk to you?

00:03:20.937 --> 00:03:24.636
I get the sense god's a
little busy for house calls.

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:27.903
No, he -- He
sent someone.

00:03:27.937 --> 00:03:29.304
Someone?

00:03:29.337 --> 00:03:31.337
An angel.

00:03:33.237 --> 00:03:37.603
It came to me in this
beautiful white light.

00:03:37.636 --> 00:03:42.736
And it filled me with this...feeling.

00:03:42.770 --> 00:03:45.603
It's -- It's
hard to describe.

00:03:45.636 --> 00:03:47.237
And this angel...

00:03:47.270 --> 00:03:49.103
Spoke god's word.

00:03:49.137 --> 00:03:52.937
And the word was to kill someone?

00:03:52.970 --> 00:03:56.370
I know it sounds strange.

00:03:56.404 --> 00:03:58.603
But what i did was very important.

00:03:58.636 --> 00:04:00.937
I helped him smite an evil man.

00:04:00.970 --> 00:04:03.870
I was chosen...

00:04:03.903 --> 00:04:06.404
For redemption.

00:04:06.436 --> 00:04:09.370
This man you stabbed -- Did
the angel give you his name?

00:04:09.404 --> 00:04:10.703
No.

00:04:10.736 --> 00:04:13.469
He just told me to wait for the sign,

00:04:13.503 --> 00:04:15.237
And the very next day,

00:04:15.270 --> 00:04:17.503
I saw it right beside the man's doorway,

00:04:17.536 --> 00:04:18.703
And i knew.

00:04:18.736 --> 00:04:19.803
Why him?

00:04:19.836 --> 00:04:22.370
I just know what
the angel told me --

00:04:22.404 --> 00:04:26.103
That this man was guilty
to his deepest foundations.

00:04:28.103 --> 00:04:30.037
And that was good enough for me.

00:04:50.103 --> 00:04:52.237
Hey.

00:04:59.337 --> 00:05:00.703
Sam: hey!

00:05:02.037 --> 00:05:04.436
Hey, man, you got to try this.

00:05:04.469 --> 00:05:06.770
I mean, there really is
magic in the magic fingers.

00:05:06.803 --> 00:05:09.636
Dean, you're enjoying that way too much.

00:05:09.670 --> 00:05:11.803
It's kind of making me uncomfortable.

00:05:11.836 --> 00:05:14.469
You got me on lockdown here.
I'm bored out of my skull.

00:05:14.503 --> 00:05:18.870
Hey, you were the bank robber
on the 11:00 news, not me.

00:05:18.903 --> 00:05:21.469
We can't risk you just walking
into a government facility.

00:05:21.503 --> 00:05:22.503
Mmm.

00:05:28.270 --> 00:05:30.270
Aw, damn it.

00:05:30.304 --> 00:05:32.137
That was my last quarter.

00:05:32.170 --> 00:05:33.803
Hey!

00:05:33.836 --> 00:05:35.703
You got any quarters?

00:05:35.736 --> 00:05:37.003
No.

00:05:39.037 --> 00:05:41.003
So, did you get in to
see that crazy hooker?

00:05:41.037 --> 00:05:42.937
Yeah. Gloria sitnik.

00:05:42.970 --> 00:05:44.770
And i'm not so sure she's crazy.

00:05:44.803 --> 00:05:46.503
But she seriously believes

00:05:46.536 --> 00:05:48.337
That she was... touched by an angel?

00:05:48.370 --> 00:05:49.970
Yeah.

00:05:50.003 --> 00:05:52.503
Blinding light, feelings of
spiritual ecstasy, the works.

00:05:52.536 --> 00:05:55.270
I mean, she's living in a locked ward,

00:05:55.304 --> 00:05:57.304
And she's totally at peace.

00:05:57.337 --> 00:05:59.370
Oh, yeah, you're right
-- Sounds completely sane.

00:05:59.404 --> 00:06:01.203
What about the dude she stabbed?

00:06:01.237 --> 00:06:02.703
Uh, carl gulley.

00:06:02.736 --> 00:06:04.503
Said she killed him 'cause he was evil.

00:06:04.536 --> 00:06:05.970
Was he? I don't know.

00:06:06.003 --> 00:06:08.003
I couldn't find any dirt on him.

00:06:08.037 --> 00:06:09.636
He didn't have a criminal record,

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:12.037
He worked at the campus
library, had lots of friends,

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:13.736
Was a churchgoer.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:16.870
Hmm. So gloria's just
your standard-Issue wacko?

00:06:16.903 --> 00:06:20.436
I mean, she wouldn't be
the first nutjob in history

00:06:20.469 --> 00:06:23.170
To kill in the name of
religion, know what i mean?

00:06:23.203 --> 00:06:24.937
No, but she's the second in town

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:27.070
To murder because an angel told them to.

00:06:27.103 --> 00:06:28.603
Little bit odd, don't you think?

00:06:28.636 --> 00:06:30.370
Odd -- Yeah.
Supernatural -- Maybe.

00:06:30.404 --> 00:06:32.103
But angels -- I
don't think so.

00:06:32.137 --> 00:06:33.603
Why not?

00:06:33.636 --> 00:06:36.503
'Cause there's no such thing, sam.

00:06:36.536 --> 00:06:39.937
Dean, there's 10 times
as much lore about angels

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:42.404
As there is about anything
else we've ever hunted.

00:06:42.436 --> 00:06:44.304
There's a ton of lore on unicorns, too.

00:06:44.337 --> 00:06:47.003
I hear that they ride
on silver moonbeams

00:06:47.037 --> 00:06:49.237
And they shoot rainbows
out of their ass.

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:51.237
Wait, there's no such thing as unicorns?

00:06:51.270 --> 00:06:53.170
That's cute.

00:06:53.203 --> 00:06:55.736
I'm just saying, man,
there's some legends

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:58.970
That you just file under "bull crap."

00:06:59.003 --> 00:07:01.703
And you got angels on
the "bull crap" list?

00:07:01.736 --> 00:07:02.770
Yep.

00:07:02.803 --> 00:07:03.870
Why?

00:07:03.903 --> 00:07:06.370
Because i've never seen one.

00:07:06.404 --> 00:07:07.636
So what?

00:07:07.670 --> 00:07:10.137
So i believe in what i can see.

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:12.003
Dean, you and i have seen things

00:07:12.037 --> 00:07:13.970
Most people couldn't even dream about.

00:07:14.003 --> 00:07:15.569
Exactly.

00:07:15.603 --> 00:07:17.970
With our own eyes --
That's hard proof, okay?

00:07:18.003 --> 00:07:19.436
But in all this time,

00:07:19.469 --> 00:07:21.903
I have never seen anything
that looks like an angel.

00:07:21.937 --> 00:07:24.870
Don't you think we would
have crossed paths with them

00:07:24.903 --> 00:07:27.170
Or at least know someone
that crossed paths with them?

00:07:27.203 --> 00:07:29.937
No. This is a demon or a spirit.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:32.404
They find people a few
fries short of a happy meal,

00:07:32.436 --> 00:07:34.337
And they trick them into
killing these randoms.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:36.270
Maybe.

00:07:38.903 --> 00:07:41.304
Can we just -- I'm
going stir-Crazy, man.

00:07:41.337 --> 00:07:44.137
Let's go by gloria's apartment, huh?

00:07:44.170 --> 00:07:46.536
I was just there. Nothing.

00:07:46.569 --> 00:07:48.270
No sulfur, no e.M.F.

00:07:48.304 --> 00:07:51.404
You didn't see any fluffy,
white wing feathers?

00:07:52.803 --> 00:07:55.270
But gloria did say the
angel gave her a sign

00:07:55.304 --> 00:07:57.603
Right beside carl gulley's doorway.

00:07:57.636 --> 00:08:00.703
Could be something at his
house. It's worth checking out.

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:29.203
Hey, sam.

00:08:29.237 --> 00:08:31.736
Think i found it.

00:08:34.353 --> 00:08:37.320
It's a sign from up above.

00:08:43.420 --> 00:08:46.386
I think i learned a valuable lesson.

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.820
Always take down your
christmas decorations

00:08:48.853 --> 00:08:50.153
After new year's,

00:08:50.186 --> 00:08:53.119
Or you might get filleted
by a hooker from god.

00:08:53.153 --> 00:08:57.453
I'm laughing on the inside.

00:09:19.587 --> 00:09:21.119
You know, gloria said

00:09:21.153 --> 00:09:23.453
The guy was guilty to
his deepest foundations.

00:09:23.486 --> 00:09:27.054
You think she literally
meant the foundation?

00:09:46.587 --> 00:09:48.687
Hmm.

00:10:10.653 --> 00:10:14.054
You got something?

00:10:16.153 --> 00:10:17.820
What is it?

00:10:21.987 --> 00:10:24.054
It's a fingernail.

00:10:44.987 --> 00:10:48.753
So much for the innocent
churchgoing librarian.

00:10:48.787 --> 00:10:50.687
Whatever spoke to gloria about this

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:53.420
Knew what it was talking
about -- I'll give you that.

00:12:42.453 --> 00:12:43.520
Yes?

00:12:43.553 --> 00:12:46.386
Hi. My name is zach.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:47.920
Can i help you?

00:12:49.219 --> 00:12:51.186
Ugh!

00:13:18.723 --> 00:13:20.723
Did you bring quarters?

00:13:24.607 --> 00:13:28.228
Dude, i'm not enabling your sick habit.

00:13:28.306 --> 00:13:30.690
You're like one of those lab rats

00:13:30.703 --> 00:13:32.723
That pushes the pleasure button
instead of the food button

00:13:32.736 --> 00:13:33.536
Until it dies.

00:13:34.020 --> 00:13:35.953
What are you talking about?
I eat. And i got news.

00:13:35.986 --> 00:13:37.986
Me too. All right, you go first.

00:13:38.020 --> 00:13:40.187
Three students have disappeared
off the campus this year.

00:13:40.220 --> 00:13:41.853
All of them were last
seen at the library.

00:13:41.886 --> 00:13:45.320
Where carl gulley worked. Sick bastard.

00:13:45.353 --> 00:13:46.953
So gloria's
angel -- Angel?

00:13:46.986 --> 00:13:48.953
Okay, whatever this thing is.

00:13:48.986 --> 00:13:51.786
Whatever it is, it struck again. What?

00:13:51.820 --> 00:13:53.653
I was listening to the police radio.

00:13:53.686 --> 00:13:55.853
There was this guy, zach
smith, some local drunk.

00:13:55.886 --> 00:13:57.986
He went up to a stranger's
front door last night,

00:13:58.020 --> 00:13:59.554
Stabbed him in the heart.

00:13:59.586 --> 00:14:01.986
I'm guessing he went to
the police and confessed?

00:14:02.020 --> 00:14:04.120
Yep. Roma downey made him do it.

00:14:04.153 --> 00:14:06.220
Now, i, uh...

00:14:06.253 --> 00:14:09.786
Got the victim's address.

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:45.203
Find anything?

00:14:45.236 --> 00:14:47.403
Frank liked his catalog shopping.

00:14:47.437 --> 00:14:49.336
That's about all i got. You?

00:14:49.370 --> 00:14:51.203
Not much here.

00:14:51.236 --> 00:14:54.170
Except he's got this one locked
file on his computer that...

00:14:54.203 --> 00:14:55.703
Hold on.

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:06.036
Not anymore.

00:15:07.770 --> 00:15:10.236
God. What?

00:15:10.270 --> 00:15:12.036
He's got all these e-Mails,

00:15:12.069 --> 00:15:15.170
Dozens, to this lady named jennifer.

00:15:19.236 --> 00:15:22.370
This lady who's 13 years old.

00:15:22.403 --> 00:15:24.303
Oh, i don't want to hear this.

00:15:24.336 --> 00:15:26.737
Looks like they met in a chat room.

00:15:26.770 --> 00:15:31.003
These e-Mails are
pretty personal, dean.

00:15:31.036 --> 00:15:32.470
Look at that.

00:15:32.503 --> 00:15:35.236
Setting up a time and
place to meet. Great.

00:15:35.270 --> 00:15:38.936
They were supposed to meet today.

00:15:40.403 --> 00:15:41.503
Huh.

00:15:41.537 --> 00:15:44.103
Well, i guess if you're
gonna stab someone,

00:15:44.136 --> 00:15:46.103
Good timing.

00:15:46.136 --> 00:15:48.570
I don't know, man. This is weird.

00:15:48.603 --> 00:15:51.804
I mean, sure, some spirits
are out for vengeance,

00:15:51.837 --> 00:15:54.370
But this one's almost
like a do-Gooder, like a --

00:15:54.403 --> 00:15:56.203
Avenging angel?

00:15:56.236 --> 00:15:59.303
Well, how else do you explain it, dean?

00:15:59.336 --> 00:16:01.303
Three guys not connected to each other

00:16:01.336 --> 00:16:02.969
All stabbed through the heart?

00:16:03.003 --> 00:16:05.537
At least two were world-Class pervs,

00:16:05.570 --> 00:16:07.804
And i bet if you dug deep
enough on the other guy --

00:16:07.837 --> 00:16:09.236
Hey. What?

00:16:09.270 --> 00:16:11.136
You said carl gulley
was a churchgoer, right?

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:12.236
Yeah.

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.603
What was the name of his church?

00:16:14.637 --> 00:16:18.737
Uh... our lady of the angels?

00:16:18.770 --> 00:16:20.837
Of course that would be the name.

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:22.969
Looks like frank went
to the same church.

00:16:33.003 --> 00:16:35.170
Man: so, you're interested
in joining the parish?

00:16:35.203 --> 00:16:38.003
We just don't feel right unless
we hit church every sunday.

00:16:38.036 --> 00:16:39.570
Where'd you say you lived before?

00:16:39.603 --> 00:16:40.904
Premont, texas.

00:16:40.936 --> 00:16:44.236
Really? At's a nice
town. St. Teresa's parish.

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:45.804
You must know the priest there.

00:16:45.837 --> 00:16:48.969
Sure, yeah. No, it's fr. O'malley.

00:16:49.003 --> 00:16:51.437
I know a fr. Shaughnessy.

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.437
Shaughnessy, exactly. What did i say?

00:16:53.470 --> 00:16:55.570
You know, we're just happy
to be here now, father.

00:16:55.603 --> 00:16:56.837
And we're happy to have you.

00:16:56.870 --> 00:16:59.737
We could use some
young blood around here.

00:16:59.770 --> 00:17:02.136
I got to ask -- No offense,
but the neighborhood...

00:17:02.170 --> 00:17:04.603
It's gone to seed a little.
There's no denying that.

00:17:04.637 --> 00:17:07.003
But that's why what the church
does here is so important.

00:17:07.036 --> 00:17:09.003
Like i always say, you
can expect a miracle,

00:17:09.036 --> 00:17:11.036
But in the meantime,
you work your butt off.

00:17:11.069 --> 00:17:12.804
Yeah, we heard about the murders.

00:17:12.837 --> 00:17:14.737
The victims were parishioners of mine.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:16.336
I've known them for years.

00:17:16.370 --> 00:17:19.003
And the killers said that
an angel made them do that?

00:17:19.036 --> 00:17:21.170
Yes. Misguided souls.

00:17:21.203 --> 00:17:22.936
To think that god's messenger

00:17:22.969 --> 00:17:26.003
Would appear and incite people
to murder -- It's tragic.

00:17:26.036 --> 00:17:28.470
So, you don't believe in
those angel yarns, huh?

00:17:28.503 --> 00:17:30.203
Oh, no, i absolutely believe.

00:17:30.236 --> 00:17:32.103
It kind of goes with
the job description.

00:17:32.136 --> 00:17:34.537
Father, that's michael, right?

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.603
That's right.

00:17:36.637 --> 00:17:40.670
The archangel michael,
with the flaming sword --

00:17:40.703 --> 00:17:43.069
The fighter of demons,

00:17:43.103 --> 00:17:46.069
Holy force against evil.

00:17:46.103 --> 00:17:48.136
So, they're not really
the hallmark-Card version

00:17:48.170 --> 00:17:50.203
That everybody thinks?

00:17:50.236 --> 00:17:52.069
They're fierce, right? Vigilant.

00:17:52.103 --> 00:17:54.804
I like to think of them as
more loving than wrathful,

00:17:54.837 --> 00:17:56.570
But, yes,

00:17:56.603 --> 00:18:00.336
A lot of scripture paints
angels as god's warriors.

00:18:00.370 --> 00:18:02.904
"An angel of the lord appeared to them,

00:18:02.936 --> 00:18:05.770
"The glory of the lord
shone down upon them,

00:18:05.804 --> 00:18:08.770
And they were terrified."

00:18:12.969 --> 00:18:15.570
Luke 2:9.

00:18:21.470 --> 00:18:23.570
Well, thank you for
speaking with us, father.

00:18:23.603 --> 00:18:25.670
It's my pleasure. Hope to see you again.

00:18:25.703 --> 00:18:27.804
Father, what's all that for?

00:18:29.103 --> 00:18:32.336
Oh, that's for fr. Gregory.
He was a priest here.

00:18:32.370 --> 00:18:33.570
Was?

00:18:33.603 --> 00:18:35.370
Passed away right on these steps.

00:18:35.403 --> 00:18:37.236
He's interred in the church crypt.

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:39.003
When did this happen?

00:18:39.036 --> 00:18:42.403
Two months ago. He was
shot for his car keys.

00:18:42.437 --> 00:18:43.570
I'm sorry.

00:18:43.603 --> 00:18:47.036
Yeah, me too. He was a good friend.

00:18:47.069 --> 00:18:50.603
I didn't even have time to
administer his last rites.

00:18:50.637 --> 00:18:53.036
But like i said, it's
a tough neighborhood.

00:18:53.069 --> 00:18:57.170
And ever since he died, i've
been praying my heart out.

00:18:57.203 --> 00:18:58.170
For what?

00:18:58.203 --> 00:18:59.537
For deliverance...

00:18:59.570 --> 00:19:01.870
From the violence and
the bloodshed around here.

00:19:03.370 --> 00:19:07.270
We could use a little divine
intervention, i suppose.

00:19:07.303 --> 00:19:09.870
Well, padre, thanks.

00:19:09.904 --> 00:19:11.503
We'll see you again.

00:19:23.804 --> 00:19:26.069
Well, it's all starting to make sense.

00:19:26.103 --> 00:19:28.470
Devoted priest dies
a violent death --

00:19:28.503 --> 00:19:31.036
That's vengeful-Spirit
material right there.

00:19:31.069 --> 00:19:33.470
He knew all the stiffs 'cause
they went to church here.

00:19:33.503 --> 00:19:35.437
I'm willing to bet,
because he was their priest,

00:19:35.470 --> 00:19:37.437
He knew things about them
that nobody else knew.

00:19:37.470 --> 00:19:41.069
Then again, fr. Reynolds
started praying for god's help

00:19:41.103 --> 00:19:42.670
About two months ago, right?

00:19:42.703 --> 00:19:45.236
Right about the time all this started?

00:19:45.270 --> 00:19:48.103
Oh, come on, man. What's
your deal? What do you mean?

00:19:48.136 --> 00:19:50.069
Look, i'll admit, i'm
a bit of a skeptic,

00:19:50.103 --> 00:19:52.003
But since when are
you all mr. "700 club?"

00:19:52.036 --> 00:19:54.303
Seriously, from the get-Go,

00:19:54.336 --> 00:19:56.637
You've been willing to
buy this angel crap, man.

00:19:56.670 --> 00:19:59.703
What's next? Are you gonna
start praying every day?

00:19:59.737 --> 00:20:01.303
I do.

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:03.837
What?

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:06.136
I do pray every day.

00:20:06.170 --> 00:20:08.103
I have for a long time.

00:20:11.804 --> 00:20:14.303
The things you learn about a guy.

00:20:14.336 --> 00:20:16.470
Huh.

00:20:17.503 --> 00:20:21.036
Come on. Let's go check
out fr. Gregory's grave.

00:21:03.759 --> 00:21:05.527
Sam, come on, get the lead out.

00:21:07.826 --> 00:21:09.693
Sammy?

00:21:11.360 --> 00:21:13.426
Sammy! Hey.

00:21:14.459 --> 00:21:16.660
Okay?

00:21:16.693 --> 00:21:18.426
Yeah.

00:21:18.459 --> 00:21:20.860
Yeah.

00:21:24.143 --> 00:21:26.177
Come on.

00:21:30.543 --> 00:21:32.877
You saw it, didn't you? Didn't you?

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:35.743
Yeah. Yeah.

00:21:35.776 --> 00:21:37.943
Dean, i saw an angel.

00:21:37.977 --> 00:21:39.843
You
--

00:21:42.077 --> 00:21:43.610
All right, come on.

00:21:45.743 --> 00:21:47.476
I don't want a drink.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:54.977
So, what makes you think
you saw a, uh, angel?

00:21:55.010 --> 00:21:57.743
Just...

00:21:57.776 --> 00:22:00.110
It appeared before
me, and i just --

00:22:00.143 --> 00:22:03.110
This feeling washed over me, you know?

00:22:03.143 --> 00:22:06.476
Like -- Like
peace, like grace.

00:22:06.509 --> 00:22:08.843
Okay, ecstasy boy, maybe we'll get you

00:22:08.877 --> 00:22:11.643
Some glow sticks and a
nice dr. Seuss hat, huh?

00:22:11.676 --> 00:22:13.676
Dean, i'm serious.

00:22:13.710 --> 00:22:15.810
It spoke to me. It knew who i was.

00:22:15.843 --> 00:22:18.344
It's just a spirit, sam.

00:22:18.409 --> 00:22:20.509
And it's not the first one

00:22:20.543 --> 00:22:22.177
To be able to read people's minds.

00:22:22.210 --> 00:22:24.376
Okay, let
me guess --

00:22:24.409 --> 00:22:26.409
You were personally chosen
to smite some sinner?

00:22:26.443 --> 00:22:28.476
You just got to wait
for me divine bat signal.

00:22:28.509 --> 00:22:31.344
Is that it? Yeah, actually.

00:22:31.376 --> 00:22:33.443
Great.

00:22:33.476 --> 00:22:36.077
I don't suppose you asked
what this alleged bad guy did.

00:22:36.110 --> 00:22:40.210
Actually, i did, dean,
and the angel told me.

00:22:40.244 --> 00:22:42.509
He hasn't done anything... yet.

00:22:42.543 --> 00:22:44.977
But he will.

00:22:45.010 --> 00:22:47.676
Oh, this is -- I
don't believe this.

00:22:47.710 --> 00:22:49.910
Dean, the angel hasn't been wrong yet.

00:22:49.943 --> 00:22:53.110
Someone's gonna do something
awful, and i can stop it.

00:22:53.143 --> 00:22:55.476
You're supposed to be bad, too, sam.

00:22:55.509 --> 00:22:56.977
Maybe i should stop you right now.

00:22:57.010 --> 00:22:58.943
You know what, dean? I don't understand.

00:22:58.977 --> 00:23:01.043
Why can't you even
consider the possibility?

00:23:01.077 --> 00:23:03.409
What, that this is an angel? Yes.

00:23:03.443 --> 00:23:06.509
Maybe we're hunting an angel
here, and we should stop.

00:23:06.543 --> 00:23:09.277
Maybe this is god's will.

00:23:09.310 --> 00:23:11.843
Okay. All right.

00:23:11.877 --> 00:23:13.977
You know what? I get
it. You've got faith.

00:23:14.010 --> 00:23:15.610
That's -- Hey,
good for you.

00:23:15.643 --> 00:23:17.409
I'm sure it makes things easier.

00:23:18.910 --> 00:23:21.177
I'll tell you who else
had faith like that -- Mom.

00:23:22.810 --> 00:23:24.943
She used to tell me
when she tucked me in

00:23:24.977 --> 00:23:27.177
That angels were watching over us.

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:29.710
In fact, that was the last
thing she ever said to me.

00:23:29.743 --> 00:23:31.509
You never told me that.

00:23:31.543 --> 00:23:33.344
What's to tell?

00:23:33.376 --> 00:23:35.010
She was wrong.

00:23:35.043 --> 00:23:37.977
There was nothing protecting her.

00:23:38.010 --> 00:23:41.344
There's no higher power. There's no god.

00:23:41.376 --> 00:23:44.476
There's just chaos and violence

00:23:44.509 --> 00:23:49.376
And random, unpredictable
evil that comes out of nowhere

00:23:49.409 --> 00:23:51.776
And rips you to shreds.

00:23:51.810 --> 00:23:54.344
You want me to believe in this stuff?

00:23:54.376 --> 00:23:56.277
I'm gonna need to see some hard proof.

00:23:56.310 --> 00:23:57.476
You got any?

00:23:59.943 --> 00:24:01.344
Well, i do.

00:24:01.376 --> 00:24:04.210
Proof that we're dealing with a spirit.

00:24:12.409 --> 00:24:14.043
That looks
like --

00:24:14.077 --> 00:24:15.576
It's wormwood...

00:24:15.610 --> 00:24:17.376
A plant associated with the dead,

00:24:17.409 --> 00:24:19.509
Specifically the ones
that are not at rest.

00:24:19.543 --> 00:24:21.877
I don't see it growing anywhere else,

00:24:21.910 --> 00:24:24.543
Except over the
murdered priest's marker.

00:24:24.576 --> 00:24:27.244
It's him, sam.

00:24:27.277 --> 00:24:29.177
Maybe.

00:24:30.610 --> 00:24:32.010
Maybe?

00:24:32.043 --> 00:24:33.877
Dean, i don't know what to think.

00:24:33.910 --> 00:24:35.576
Okay.

00:24:37.409 --> 00:24:39.810
Want some more proof?
I'll give you more proof.

00:24:39.843 --> 00:24:41.244
How?

00:24:41.277 --> 00:24:43.476
We'll summon gregory's spirit.

00:24:43.509 --> 00:24:45.110
What?

00:24:45.143 --> 00:24:47.943
Here? In the church?

00:24:47.977 --> 00:24:49.610
Yeah.

00:24:49.643 --> 00:24:52.776
Yeah, we just need a few odds and ends

00:24:52.810 --> 00:24:55.177
And that sance ritual in dad's journal.

00:24:55.210 --> 00:24:58.310
A sance, great. I
hope whoopi's available.

00:24:58.344 --> 00:25:00.509
That's funny, actually. Seriously.

00:25:02.010 --> 00:25:03.710
If fr. Gregory's spirit is around,

00:25:03.743 --> 00:25:05.610
The sance will bring him right to us.

00:25:05.643 --> 00:25:08.509
If it's him, then we'll put him to rest.

00:25:08.543 --> 00:25:10.743
But if it's an angel, it won't show.

00:25:10.776 --> 00:25:12.509
Nothing will happen.

00:25:12.543 --> 00:25:14.010
Exactly.

00:25:14.043 --> 00:25:15.910
It's one of the perks of the job, sam.

00:25:15.943 --> 00:25:17.643
We don't have to operate on faith.

00:25:17.676 --> 00:25:19.977
We can know for sure.

00:25:20.010 --> 00:25:22.110
Don't you want to know for sure?

00:25:28.710 --> 00:25:30.543
Dude...

00:25:30.576 --> 00:25:31.743
All right, i'll admit,

00:25:31.776 --> 00:25:34.376
We've gone pretty ghetto
with the spell work before,

00:25:34.409 --> 00:25:35.643
But this takes the cake.

00:25:35.676 --> 00:25:38.543
I mean, a spongebob place
mat instead of an altar cloth?

00:25:38.576 --> 00:25:40.843
We'll just put it
spongebob-Side-Down.

00:25:44.710 --> 00:25:46.277
Dean, that's it.

00:25:46.310 --> 00:25:47.344
What?

00:25:47.376 --> 00:25:49.843
That's the sign.

00:25:49.877 --> 00:25:51.610
Where?

00:25:51.643 --> 00:25:52.843
Right behind that guy.

00:25:52.877 --> 00:25:54.610
That's him, dean.

00:25:54.643 --> 00:25:57.010
And we have to stop him.

00:26:03.360 --> 00:26:04.626
Wait a minute.

00:26:04.659 --> 00:26:06.027
What are you doing?

00:26:06.060 --> 00:26:09.127
You're not gonna kill somebody
because a ghost told you to.

00:26:09.160 --> 00:26:11.494
I'm not gonna kill
him. I'm gonna stop him.

00:26:11.526 --> 00:26:14.693
Define "stop," huh? I
mean, what are you gonna do?

00:26:14.726 --> 00:26:16.460
Dean, please.

00:26:16.494 --> 00:26:18.327
He's gonna hurt someone. You know it.

00:26:20.893 --> 00:26:23.726
All right, come on.

00:26:29.760 --> 00:26:31.027
Dean.

00:26:32.394 --> 00:26:33.726
Unlock my door.

00:26:33.760 --> 00:26:35.893
You're not killing anyone, sam.

00:26:35.926 --> 00:26:37.860
I got this guy. You go do the sance.

00:26:37.893 --> 00:26:39.793
Dean.

00:28:10.860 --> 00:28:12.893
What are you doing?

00:28:12.926 --> 00:28:14.926
What is this?

00:28:18.160 --> 00:28:21.860
Father, please. I can explain.

00:28:21.893 --> 00:28:23.893
Uh...

00:28:23.926 --> 00:28:26.360
Actually, maybe i can't. Um...

00:28:29.193 --> 00:28:32.127
This is a... a sance.

00:28:32.160 --> 00:28:33.693
A sance?

00:28:33.726 --> 00:28:36.127
Young man, you are in a house of god.

00:28:36.160 --> 00:28:38.626
It's based on early christian
rites, if that helps.

00:28:38.659 --> 00:28:40.659
Enough. You're coming with me.

00:28:40.693 --> 00:28:43.593
Father, please, just wait a second.

00:28:46.093 --> 00:28:48.227
Oh, my god.

00:28:50.027 --> 00:28:52.327
Is that...

00:28:52.360 --> 00:28:54.093
Is that an angel?

00:28:54.127 --> 00:28:56.559
No, it's not.

00:28:56.593 --> 00:29:00.960
It's just fr. Gregory.

00:29:07.593 --> 00:29:09.060
Thomas!

00:29:09.093 --> 00:29:12.427
I've come in answer to your prayers.

00:29:31.593 --> 00:29:34.659
Sam....i thought i
sent you on your path.

00:29:34.693 --> 00:29:36.494
You should hurry.

00:29:37.760 --> 00:29:38.993
Father, i'm sorry.

00:29:41.893 --> 00:29:43.760
But you're not an angel.

00:29:43.793 --> 00:29:45.693
Of course i am.

00:29:45.726 --> 00:29:47.793
No.

00:29:47.826 --> 00:29:49.160
You're a man.

00:29:49.193 --> 00:29:52.860
You're a spirit.

00:29:52.893 --> 00:29:54.659
And you need to rest.

00:29:54.693 --> 00:29:57.093
I was a man...

00:29:57.127 --> 00:29:58.626
But now i'm an angel.

00:30:01.160 --> 00:30:03.926
I was on the steps at the church.

00:30:03.960 --> 00:30:07.193
I felt that bullet
pierce right through me.

00:30:07.227 --> 00:30:10.060
But there was no pain.

00:30:10.093 --> 00:30:13.327
And, suddenly, i could see...

00:30:13.360 --> 00:30:14.993
Everything.

00:30:17.526 --> 00:30:19.360
Fr. Reynolds, i saw you...

00:30:19.394 --> 00:30:22.293
Praying and crying here.

00:30:22.327 --> 00:30:25.360
I came to help you.

00:30:25.394 --> 00:30:27.394
Help me how?

00:30:54.926 --> 00:30:56.494
Damn it!

00:30:57.893 --> 00:30:59.559
Those
murders --

00:30:59.593 --> 00:31:02.293
That was because of you?

00:31:02.327 --> 00:31:04.193
I received the word of god.

00:31:04.227 --> 00:31:07.193
He spoke to me, told
me to smite the wicked.

00:31:07.227 --> 00:31:09.427
I'm carrying out his will.

00:31:09.460 --> 00:31:11.427
You're driving innocent people to kill.

00:31:11.460 --> 00:31:14.860
Those innocent people are
being offered redemption.

00:31:17.726 --> 00:31:19.626
Some people need redemption.

00:31:19.659 --> 00:31:21.693
Don't they, sam?

00:31:23.093 --> 00:31:24.826
How can you call this redemption?

00:31:26.993 --> 00:31:29.260
You can't understand it now.

00:31:29.293 --> 00:31:31.726
But the rules of man
and the rules of god

00:31:31.760 --> 00:31:33.160
Are two very different things.

00:31:33.193 --> 00:31:37.160
Those people --
They're locked up.

00:31:37.193 --> 00:31:38.726
No, they're happy.

00:31:38.760 --> 00:31:42.127
They've found peace,
beaten their demons.

00:31:42.160 --> 00:31:44.494
And i've given them the keys to heaven.

00:31:44.526 --> 00:31:46.494
No, no. This is vengeance.

00:31:46.526 --> 00:31:47.926
It's wrong.

00:31:47.960 --> 00:31:50.993
Thomas, this goes against
everything you believed.

00:31:51.027 --> 00:31:53.093
You're lost, misguided.

00:31:53.127 --> 00:31:56.593
Father... no, i'm not misguided.

00:31:56.626 --> 00:31:58.926
You are not an angel, thomas.

00:31:58.960 --> 00:32:01.127
Men cannot be angels.

00:32:03.993 --> 00:32:06.394
But...

00:32:06.427 --> 00:32:09.293
But i-I don't understand.

00:32:13.659 --> 00:32:15.293
You prayed for me to come.

00:32:15.327 --> 00:32:17.760
I prayed for god's help, not this.

00:32:17.793 --> 00:32:21.193
What you're doing is not god's will.

00:32:21.227 --> 00:32:23.360
"Thou shalt not kill."

00:32:23.394 --> 00:32:25.394
That's the word of god.

00:32:34.127 --> 00:32:35.960
How come we stopped?

00:32:41.260 --> 00:32:45.593
Um, weren't we gonna go to the movies?

00:32:47.826 --> 00:32:50.760
We should go, or we're gonna be late.

00:32:50.793 --> 00:32:52.394
I'm sorry.

00:32:52.427 --> 00:32:54.427
It's just, i've never done this before.

00:32:56.160 --> 00:32:58.860
Look, i said i was sorry.

00:32:58.893 --> 00:33:00.659
Please...

00:33:08.360 --> 00:33:09.960
Stop it!

00:33:22.926 --> 00:33:24.860
Are you okay? Are you okay?

00:33:24.893 --> 00:33:27.893
Thank god! Thank god!

00:33:29.427 --> 00:33:30.526
Damn it.

00:33:30.559 --> 00:33:31.793
Are you sure you're okay?

00:33:31.826 --> 00:33:35.693
You have a cellphone? Call 911.

00:33:52.593 --> 00:33:54.526
Let us help you.

00:33:54.559 --> 00:33:56.760
No.

00:33:56.793 --> 00:33:59.593
It's time to rest,
thomas, to be at peace.

00:33:59.626 --> 00:34:03.060
Please. Let me give you last rites.

00:34:11.526 --> 00:34:13.260
O holy hosts above,

00:34:13.293 --> 00:34:16.093
I call upon thee as a servant of christ

00:34:16.127 --> 00:34:18.593
To sanctify our actions this day

00:34:18.626 --> 00:34:20.860
In fulfillment of the will of god.

00:34:27.227 --> 00:34:29.526
Fr. Reynolds?

00:34:29.559 --> 00:34:32.060
Rest.

00:34:41.793 --> 00:34:44.793
I call upon the archangel raphael,

00:34:44.826 --> 00:34:49.027
Master of the air, to make open the way.

00:34:49.060 --> 00:34:53.060
Let the fire of the
holy spirit now descend,

00:34:53.093 --> 00:34:57.726
That this being might be
awakened to the world beyond.

00:36:24.027 --> 00:36:25.726
Holy...

00:37:03.443 --> 00:37:05.310
<i>How was your day?</i>

00:37:13.344 --> 00:37:15.043
You were right.

00:37:17.110 --> 00:37:19.576
It wasn't an angel. It was gregory.

00:37:41.443 --> 00:37:44.443
I don't know, dean, i just...

00:37:49.443 --> 00:37:52.643
I wanted to believe...

00:37:52.676 --> 00:37:55.177
So badly.

00:37:57.110 --> 00:37:59.443
It's so damn
hard to do this --

00:37:59.476 --> 00:38:01.877
What
we do --

00:38:01.910 --> 00:38:05.376
All alone, you know?

00:38:05.409 --> 00:38:07.776
There's so much evil
out in the world, dean,

00:38:07.810 --> 00:38:10.310
I feel like i could drown in it.

00:38:10.344 --> 00:38:12.210
And when i think about my destiny,

00:38:12.244 --> 00:38:14.043
When i think about how i could end up...

00:38:14.077 --> 00:38:17.509
Yeah, well, don't worry
about that, all right?

00:38:17.543 --> 00:38:20.509
I'm watching out for you.

00:38:20.543 --> 00:38:22.743
Yeah, i know you are.

00:38:25.177 --> 00:38:27.610
But you're just one person, dean.

00:38:29.843 --> 00:38:31.576
And i needed to think

00:38:31.610 --> 00:38:34.443
That there was something
else watching, too, you know?

00:38:34.476 --> 00:38:39.110
Some...higher power,

00:38:39.143 --> 00:38:42.244
Some greater good.

00:38:43.877 --> 00:38:47.010
And that maybe...

00:38:47.043 --> 00:38:49.977
Maybe what?

00:38:52.843 --> 00:38:55.143
Maybe i could be saved.

00:39:01.810 --> 00:39:06.310
But, you know, that
just clouded my judgment.

00:39:06.344 --> 00:39:08.310
And you're right.

00:39:08.344 --> 00:39:10.843
I mean, we got to go with what we know,

00:39:10.877 --> 00:39:13.210
With what's right there in
front of our own two eyes.

00:39:13.244 --> 00:39:15.776
Well, it's funny you say that.

00:39:18.476 --> 00:39:19.476
Why?

00:39:22.576 --> 00:39:25.244
Gregory's spirit gave you
some pretty good information.

00:39:25.277 --> 00:39:28.476
That guy in the car was bad news.

00:39:28.509 --> 00:39:30.376
I barely got there in time.

00:39:30.409 --> 00:39:32.509
What happened?

00:39:32.543 --> 00:39:34.810
He's dead.

00:39:37.344 --> 00:39:39.043
Did you...

00:39:39.077 --> 00:39:40.344
No.

00:39:42.977 --> 00:39:46.010
But i'll tell you one thing.

00:39:46.043 --> 00:39:48.010
The way he died,

00:39:48.043 --> 00:39:50.610
If i hadn't have seen
it with my own two eyes,

00:39:50.643 --> 00:39:52.509
I never would have believed it.

00:39:52.543 --> 00:39:54.910
I mean...

00:39:54.943 --> 00:39:56.910
I don't know what to call it.

00:40:00.376 --> 00:40:01.743
What?

00:40:05.277 --> 00:40:07.010
Dean, what did you see?

00:40:09.409 --> 00:40:10.843
Maybe

00:40:15.344 --> 00:40:17.543
God's will.



00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:17.000
